		  , REPLACE(UPPER(case when EstablishmentCity is null or EstablishmentCity = '' then '' else EstablishmentCity + ', ' end + case when DistrictName is null or DistrictName='' then '' else DistrictName + ', ' end + StateName),'*','') EstablishmentFullAddress
		  , FORMAT(SaDate, 'MMMM d, yyyy') [SaDate]
		  , FORMAT(FinalSaDate, 'MMMM d, yyyy') [FinalSaDate]
		  , [CertificationBodyUserId]
		  , [AssessorUserId]
		  , [ReasonForRejection]
		  , UserName
		FROM SelfAssessments S LEFT JOIN Users U on (S.CertificationBodyUserId=U.UserId)
		WHERE SaDate IS NOT NULL --and RegistrationNumber not in ('<redacted>','<redacted>','<redacted>','<redacted>')
			AND StateName = ISNULL(@State, StateName) AND Category = ISNULL(@Category, Category)
		ORDER BY SaDate

		SELECT UserId, UserName FROM Users WHERE RoleId=2 AND IsActive = 1 ORDER BY UserName
			--SELECT UserId, UserName FROM Users WHERE RoleId=2 AND IsActive = 1 and userid not in (select distinct UserId from AgencyUserStates) 
			--union
			--SELECT u.UserId, u.UserName FROM Users u inner join AgencyUserStates AU on u.userid=au.userid
			--inner join SelfAssessments sa on au.states=sa.StateName
			--WHERE u.RoleId=2 AND u.IsActive = 1 and  SaDate IS NOT NULL AND StateName = ISNULL(@State, StateName) AND Category = ISNULL(@Category, Category) ORDER BY UserName

	END
	ELSE IF @RoleId=2
	BEGIN
		SELECT  ROW_NUMBER() OVER(ORDER BY SaDate) SNo
		  , S.[Id]
		  , S.[StateCode]
		  , [StateName]
		  , S.[DistrictCode]
		  , [DistrictName]
		  , [RespondentName]
		  , S.[MobileNo]
		  , [EmailId]
		  , S.[CreatedDate]
		  , [Gender]
		  , [RespondentAge]
		  , [Service]
		  , [Experience]
		  , S.[Email]
		  , [Status]
		  , [IsTerminated]
		  , [FinalSubmitDate]
		  , [EstablishmentType]
		  , [RespondentMobileNo]
		  , UPPER([EstablishmentName]) EstablishmentName
		  , [EstablishmentAddress]
		  , [EstablishmentPinCode]
		  , [EstablishmentPhoneNo]
		  , [EstablishmentFaxNo]
		  , [IsDeclarationAccepted]
		  , [CurrentQuestion]
		  , [CertificateNo]
		  , [Name]
		  , [IssuedOn]
		  , FORMAT(FinalSubmitDate, 'MMMM d, yyyy h:mm tt') [FinalSubmittedDate]
		  , [EstablishmentCity]
		  , [EstablishmentWebsite]
		  , S.[Acommodationtype]
		  , [TotalRooms]
		  , [RegistrationNumber]
		  , [Category]
		  , [CertificateNo]
		  , [RestaurantType]
		  , REPLACE(UPPER(case when EstablishmentCity is null or EstablishmentCity = '' then '' else EstablishmentCity + ', ' end + case when DistrictName is null or DistrictName='' then '' else DistrictName + ', ' end + StateName),'*','') EstablishmentFullAddress
		  , FORMAT(SaDate, 'MMMM d, yyyy') [SaDate]
		  , FORMAT(FinalSaDate, 'MMMM d, yyyy') [FinalSaDate]
		  , [CertificationBodyUserId]
		  , [AssessorUserId]
		  , [ReasonForRejection]
		  , UserName
		FROM SelfAssessments S LEFT JOIN Users U on (S.AssessorUserId=U.UserId)
		WHERE SaDate IS NOT NULL AND CertificationBodyUserId=@UserId --and RegistrationNumber not in ('<redacted>','<redacted>','<redacted>','<redacted>')
			AND StateName = ISNULL(@State, StateName) AND Category = ISNULL(@Category, Category)
		ORDER BY SaDate

		SELECT UserId, UserName FROM Users WHERE RoleId=3 AND CreatedBy=@UserId AND IsActive = 1 ORDER BY UserName
	END
END



